% storymator bibliography
%
% Conventions
% -----------
% Keys are lowercase surname + year + first significant title word, which
% is the style of the first entry Monte supplied (li2025tooncomposer).
%
% Every entry below was checked against the publisher's or arXiv's own
% listing on 2026-10-13, except li2025tooncomposer, which is quoted
% verbatim as supplied.  Where a venue is recorded that the arXiv listing
% does not itself state, it comes from the authors' own repository and is
% marked in a `note` field, so a reader can tell a checked venue from a
% reported one.
%
% Several of these are discussed, with their licensing, in
% docs/planning/inking-and-tween-plugins.md.  A citation here is not an
% endorsement and emphatically not a licence: see LICENSES.md.


